  "text": "(720) 419-3699\n6695 Wadsworth Blvd, Arvada, CO 80003\ninfo@arvadadentalcenter.com\nMonday - Friday | 8AM to 5PM\nTransformative Implant Dentistry\nCosmetic Dentistry\nLaser Dentistry\nTreatments\nPayment Plans\nWhat To Expect\nWho We Are\nLoyalty Program\nRequest Appointment\nFixed Full Upper Or Lower Implants Just $18,795\nSave more than $10,000 compared to the national chains seen on TV.*\n\nDr. Gregory Bennett has placed and restored thousands of implants and can give you new teeth and change your life often in just one day. Walk out with beautiful, natural-looking teeth! Start with a free consultation today.\n\nGET STARTED TODAY\nCALL DENTAL IMPLANT HOTLINE\n(720) 419-3699\nOne Team At One Location For The Entire Treatment.\nAnd For A Lot Less.\nArvada Dental Implant Office\n\n6695 Wadsworth Blvd\nArvada, CO 80003\nDirections ›\n\nFew practices – if any – in the Arvada area offer our extensive experience, expertise, and advanced digital technology to every dental implant patient and can provide such amazing pricing, $14,999, for fixed upper or lower dental implants – and all under one roof.\n\nThere’s no need to travel to different offices, meet with multiple doctors, and receive numerous bills.\n\nInstead, you can often receive your entire treatment in just one office, in one day, from a top-rated dental implant expert. Walk out with fixed, natural-looking teeth!\n\nWork with\nWORLD-CLASS, TOP-RATED DENTAL IMPLANT EXPERTS\nWork Exclusively With Dr. Gregory Bennett - Who Will Deliver And Oversee Every Phase Of Your Procedure.\n\nDr. Bennett and their team have created the ultimate destination for smile restoration by assembling a group of experienced teeth replacement professionals who work in a state-of-the-art facility to ensure your smile features ideal aesthetics and long-term success.\n\nEvery single member of the Arvada Dental Center implant team has been hand-picked for not only their outstanding skills but also for their ability and desire to treat patients with unmatched kindness and concern.\n\nThe Arvada Dental Center standard can be felt at every position throughout our Implant Surgical Center, including our front desk personnel, dental assistants, treatment plan coordinators, clinical director, and office manager. The Arvada Dental Center team works extremely well together with a strong, collective focus on one thing. YOU.\n\nTeam of implant experts with 20+ years experience\nThousands of successful dental implant cases completed\nAt Arvada Dental Center, We’ve Created What Many Feel Is The Area’s Premier Full-Arch And Full-Mouth Dental Implant Destination. Your New Smile Is Made Using Only The Best-In-Class Materials And Restored With A Meticulous Process And A Digital Workflow To Ensure Ultra-Precision And Comfort.\nAvailable Dental Implant Treatments\nAll-On-4 Dental Implants\n\nOffers you a beautiful, natural-looking smile and a full set of teeth often in just one day\n\nOverdentures\n\nCombine the anchoring power of implants with the coverage of dentures\n\nSingle Dental Implant\n\nA permanent solution that leaves your smile looking beautiful and natural\n\nPayment Plans up to 60 months\nSet your own payment terms\nFinancing options\nFull Arch\nStarting at\n$18,795\nFee Includes:\nComplete Oral Evaluation\nCone-Beam CT Scan\nAll-Extractions (if needed)\n4-6 Implants per Arch\nFixed Provision Implant Prosthesis & Final Zirconia Permanent\n\nThis cost does not include bone graft surgery (required in some cases), anesthesia or IV sedation.\n\nOverdenture\nStarting at\n$5,995\nFee Includes:\nComplete Oral Evaluation\nCone-Beam CT Scan\n2 Implants per Arch\nBasic Snap-In with 2/4\nThis cost does not include extractions (if needed), bone graft surgery (required in some cases) or anesthesia/ IV sedation.\nSingle Implant\nStarting at\n$3,999\nFee Includes:\nComplete Oral Evaluation\nCone-Beam CT Scan\n1 Implant per Tooth\nAbutment and Crown\nThis cost does not include bone graft surgery (required in some cases, extraction – if needed) or anesthesia or IV sedation.\n\n* Our patients can save more than $10,000 per arch when compared with the national chains seen on TV. Other approaches require you to travel to different locations and work with various doctors, significantly increasing the cost of treatment. At our practice, the entire treatment is handled at one location with one doctor. Further, our lab work is performed at our partner lab for more savings.\n\nFINANCING: We also offer many payment plans and options that make implants quite affordable at low monthly rates. If your credit score is average or even slightly below, we can help you apply online with a third-party financing company, and you’ll receive an instant decision in most cases. This pre-qualifying approach is a “soft” credit check. Some patients tap a friend, family member, or spouse to co-sign with them for financing if they don’t qualify. Other alternative options may also be available to you.\n\n** What is a fixed provisional, and how is that different from the final prosthesis?\nProvisional teeth are made of hard industrial plastic. They look, feel, and function like natural teeth. On the day of surgery, your provisional teeth are placed on top of the implants and remain in place for 2-4 months, allowing the appropriate amount of time for your jaw bone to adhere to the implants. After your bone securely heals to the implants, you will then receive your final lifetime teeth, usually made of zirconia, Prettau®, or other high-quality material.\n\nReal Patients. Real Results.\n\nRated 5 out of 5\nReviews On Google\n\nDr. Gregory Bennett and his team of dental implant experts enjoy hundreds of 5-star reviews on Google and Facebook. In fact, few practices in the area have a better record of patient satisfaction.\n\nGoogle Reviews\nFrequently Asked Questions\nAre dental implants the best way to replace missing teeth?\nHow long will dental implants last?\nHow do I know if I am a candidate for dental implants?\nDoes getting dental implants hurt?\nWhat can be done if I don’t have sufficient bone tissue to support implants?\nReady To Schedule Your Free Dental Implant Consultation?\n\nComplete the following questions, and a treatment coordinator will contact you to confirm your free in-office consultation.\n\nAre you located near Arvada, CO and able to come in for your free consultation? *\n\nYes, I'll come!\nNo, I can't\nNEXT \nFacebook-f\n \nYoutube\n \nGoogle-plus-g\n \nLinkedin\n \nTwitter\n \nInstagram\nContact Us\nPhone Number:\n\n(720) 419-3699\nAddress:\n\n6695 Wadsworth Blvd\nArvada, CO 80003\nHours:\nMon-Fri: 8AM to 5PM\nEmail:\ninfo@arvadadentalcenter.com\nServices\nDental Implants\nCEREC Same Day Crowns\nInvisalign\nDentures\nCosmetic Dentistry\nSedation Dentistry\nDental Surgery\nAbout Us\nDr. Bennett\nDr. McAninley\nDr. McShane\nPatient Forms\nSMS Policy\nSMS Terms & Conditions\n\nLeave Us A Review On Google\n\n© 2025 All rights reserved. | Privacy Policy | Terms & Conditions\nEspañol\nOpen toolbar\n\nAccessibility Tools\n\nIncrease Text\nDecrease Text\nGrayscale\nHigh Contrast\nNegative Contrast\nLight Background\nLinks Underline\nReadable Font\n Reset"
